<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Thorpe returns ten weeks after ezetimibe was added. He has done 18 cardiac rehabilitation sessions and now walks up the hill to the ball field without stopping. He has had no angina and no nitroglycerin since early summer. The back strain from four weeks ago settled within ten days on acetaminophen, and he is back to full sessions. He uses lip balm with sunscreen and a hat every day. He has no new sore on his lips or in his mouth and no lumps in his neck. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cardiac rehabilitation</td><td>18 sessions; walks uphill without stopping</td></tr><tr><td>Angina</td><td>None since early summer</td></tr><tr><td>Back strain</td><td>Resolved within ten days</td></tr><tr><td>Lip</td><td>No new sore; no neck lumps</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

